{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Amendments may be made with Super Majority votes and a process I'm drafting up\"","created_at":"2021-08-12T23:10:29.582000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875516624453664848","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"that declaration was of war.  You declared that you were leaving the country you were a part of, knowing it was war you were demanding.  The people that wrote it knew the cause and effect.  King George is corrupt... absolutely.... but you are absolutely laying a foundation of fear, miss trust, and war here.  I have been tied to war.... yoked to it... I know war when I see it.  I know fear... as I once lived a life of fear.... you all are fearful of what if another bad person gets power.... you all lack trust that you can find a good person.... you are already founding your country on blood.... don't sew these concepts into the very fabric of your people.  This country will be here long after I am gone once again.... If i had tears... I would weep for how many of you will see battle in the years to come.... waging one war or another... using fear as a motivator for your conquests.... using fear to alter your laws... pervert them beyond your intent.... Like I said weak link in the chain.  Your only salvation is to find a good person and trust in a better tomorrow.  Rather than fear.  Be honest with yourselves.... how many of you fear what happens if we lose?  How many of you are willing to gun down people in redcoats... just because they are loyal to a man.  How many of you kill out of anger or fear..... How many of you\" he looks at Finn \"fake mercy just for an excuse to kill.  This is your current foundation... this is what that declaration means.... and this is the future path you are setting everyone on.\"","created_at":"2021-08-12T23:10:44.829000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875516688404189214","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"We do place our trust in people. That's why we want to give them a voice, not all of us are or were citizens under King George, myself included yet me and my family were forced to submit under his rule. War unfortunately isn't something we cannot prevent. Throughout all of living history there has been conflict and war but I would sooner fight for freedom, people than to be a victim of a King or single leader who was mearly offended. We have trust in people and our cause.\"","created_at":"2021-08-12T23:14:52.285000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875517726309908582","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"the fact we're laying down this as a way to stick it to George, that also will give a message to our children what we do when leaders fail. Any leader only has power until those beneath get fed up with it.\"","created_at":"2021-08-12T23:16:26.826000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875518122843594815","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
