{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Don't assume I'd wish to see everyone who follows I leader I disagree with dead. Dont assume I'd wish to see a King dead. I simply want him out off this land and let the people here choose their government. However his response to our want of independence was war so here we are. I never wanted to kill until I had to fight for the people I choose to believe in were at risk.\"","created_at":"2021-08-12T23:26:08.493000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875520562531799070","reply_to_id":"875519767774126110","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
